<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-antirrhinum-majus-turing-wavelength-s0> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Antirrhinum majus Turing ocellus wavelength at 259 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) (Antirrhinum majus)",
