        "reported_in_source: Turing 1952: diffusion-driven instability and a critical wavenumber.",
        "transfer_boundary: The gallery pitch of 77.8 µm is a measurement of that asset.",
        "transfer_boundary: Vein-locked Venosa pigment is not shown here to be a Turing instability." ;
    pk:anatomicalStructure "Turing pigment stripe / ocellus wavelength in Antirrhinum majus" ;
    pk:aristotelianEfficientCause "1. Chemical Turing / RD" ;
    pk:aristotelianMegistonGenos "III. Phyta (Embryophyta)" ;
